    "body": "Hmm, this is not the place to report bugs in browsers. It sounds like you would like to report a bug against Firefox. To do that, use bugzilla.mozilla.org.\n\nI think Firefox's behavior is reasonable though. It is doing a full text search instead of a prefix search.\n\nI'm closing this since it doesn't seem to be a spec bug, but we're happy to continue discussing in the closed thread.\n",
