    "updated_at": "2016-08-02T14:06:10Z",
    "body": "Hmm. I still don't think this is really an issue for the spec. The user agent should be able to decide what items it displays. For example, the spec says you can display other useful items based on e.g. autofill or history: see the example at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#url-state-(type=url) where things that are not even in the `<datalist>` are displayed.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
